{"page":112,"verses":[{"verse_key":"5:24","surah":5,"ayah":24,"ar_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ إِنَّا لَن نَّدْخُلَهَآ أَبَدًا مَّا دَامُوا۟ فِيهَا ۖ فَٱذْهَبْ أَنتَ وَرَبُّكَ فَقَـٰتِلَآ إِنَّا هَـٰهُنَا قَـٰعِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They said, ‘Moses, we will never enter while they are still there, so you and your Lord go in and fight, and we will stay here.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"They said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰمُوسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"O Musa","transliteration":"yāmūsā","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَن","en_gloss":"never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَّدْخُلَهَآ","en_gloss":"will enter it","transliteration":"nadkhulahā","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَبَدًۭا","en_gloss":"ever","transliteration":"abadan","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":8,"ar":"دَامُوا۟","en_gloss":"as long as they are","transliteration":"dāmū","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَٱذْهَبْ","en_gloss":"So go","transliteration":"fa-idh'hab","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أَنتَ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"anta","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَرَبُّكَ","en_gloss":"and your Lord","transliteration":"warabbuka","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَقَـٰتِلَآ","en_gloss":"and you both fight","transliteration":"faqātilā","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":14,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":15,"ar":"هَـٰهُنَا","en_gloss":"are [here]","transliteration":"hāhunā","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":16,"ar":"قَـٰعِدُونَ","en_gloss":"sitting","transliteration":"qāʿidūna","verse_key":"5:24"},{"pos":17,"ar":"٢٤","en_gloss":"(24)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"5:24"}]},{"vers